# Accessibility

This product will be used on cracked low-end Androids, with large text, VoiceOver/TalkBack, and sometimes voice input.

- Visible focus (`focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50` is already on primitives — keep it).
- Icon-only controls need an `sr-only` label. Theme toggle and menu buttons included.
- Contrast: rely on theme tokens. Do not put muted gray text on photos without a scrim.
- Primary actions sit toward the bottom on small screens when that is the main task.
- Skip link to `#main` on every marketing page.
- Dialogs and sheets must have a title and description.
- Do not ship information only as color. Freshness and warnings need text.
- Plain language over tooltips. If a tooltip exists, the same fact must be on the page.
